OL,3,GNEWSADorset coast under flood warning
OL,4,Aas storm sweeps in
OL,5,
OL,6,FA stretch of the Dorset coast is under
OL,7,Fa flood warning as Storm Austen sweeps
OL,8,Fin.
OL,10,FThe Environment Agency (EA) has issued
OL,11,Fthe warning for the coast in the
OL,12,FChiswell area and closed the A354
OL,13,FPortland Beach Road and the Causeway
OL,14,Fafter flooding and waves overtopped the
OL,15,Froad.
OL,17,FThe EA said: "We are closely monitoring
OL,18,Fthe situation and we have staff on
OL,19,Fsite" and urged people to avoid
OL,20,Fseafronts and harbours due to wave
OL,21,Fovertopping and spray containing
OL,22,Fdebris.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,334,330,200,160,0,100
