OL,3,GNEWSADorset coast under flood warning
OL,4,Aas storm sweeps in
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe area under the flood warning also
OL,7,Fcovers Brandy Row, Pebble Lane,
OL,8,FVictoria Square up to the junction with
OL,9,FQueens Road and the car parks along the
OL,10,FA354 and the yard along Lerret Road.
